From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Open Arc Authors <dev@openarc.invalid>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:08:31 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] openarc: embedder: dock DevTools into the tab's view

DevTools for an embedder tab now loads with can_dock and follows the
front end's Dock side choice, like Chrome's docked DevTools: the tab's
view (OpenArcTabContainerView, what OACTab.nativeView returns) holds
the front end under the page and puts the page at the bounds the front
end asks for (left, bottom or right); undocked, the front end moves to
a window of its own. Developer Tools toggles a docked DevTools closed.
